{"id":"67304db766f65ebb","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Fine Structural Model","display":"df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model — ZFC Model7 Fine Structural Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model — ZFC Model7 Fine Structural Model","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model — ZFC Model7 Fine Structural Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bad389fa2bf413d7\" href=\"?note=bad389fa2bf413d7\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68012bc8b343417a\" href=\"?note=68012bc8b343417a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec E\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec E\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\)</span> (premouse predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\)</span> (projectum predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\)</span> (standard-parameter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\rho\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)\\;\\exists p\\in[\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\rho\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)\\;\\exists p\\in[\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The premouse conjunct supplies the extender-sequence structure omitted by the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\mathrm{ZF}^-\">\\(M\\models\\mathrm{ZF}^-\\)</span> condition. The imported projectum predicate enforces leastness, while the standard-parameter predicate supplies the corresponding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>-hull recovery condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md","status":"resolved","id":"bad389fa2bf413d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md","status":"resolved","id":"68012bc8b343417a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数